&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re transforming the grocery industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;im&quot;&gt;At Instacart, we invite the world to share love through food because we believe everyone should have access to the food they love and more time to enjoy it together. Where others see a simple need for grocery delivery, we see exciting complexity and endless opportunity to serve the varied needs of our community. We work to deliver an essential service that customers rely on to get their groceries and household goods, while also offering safe and flexible earnings opportunities to Instacart Personal Shoppers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instacart has become a lifeline for millions of people, and we’re building the team to help push our shopping cart forward. If you’re ready to do the best work of your life, come join our table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instacart is a Flex First team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no one-size fits all approach to how we do our best work. Our employees have the flexibility to choose where they do their best work—whether it’s from home, an office, or your favorite coffee shop—while staying connected and building community through regular in-person events. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instacart.careers/flex-first&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://instacart.careers/remote/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1651869232122000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw37OlxP8hAKN7nq4YwHQH7e&quot;&gt;Learn more about our flexible approach to where we work.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re transforming the grocery industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Instacart, we invite the world to share love through food because we believe everyone should have access to the food they love and more time to enjoy it together. Where others see a simple need for grocery delivery, we see exciting complexity and endless opportunity to serve the varied needs of our community. We work to deliver an essential service that customers rely on to get their groceries and household goods, while also offering safe and flexible earnings opportunities to Instacart Personal Shoppers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instacart has become a lifeline for millions of people, and we’re building the team to help push our shopping cart forward. If you’re ready to do the best work of your life, come join our table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instacart is a Flex First team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no one-size fits all approach to how we do our best work. Our employees have the flexibility to choose where they do their best work—whether it’s from home, an office, or your favorite coffee shop—while staying connected and building community through regular in-person events. Learn more about our flexible approach to where we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Growth Design Team focuses on driving meaningful business impact through thoughtful strategy, experimentation, and exceptional craft. We design the end-to-end journeys that help customers discover, understand, and engage with the value of Instacart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work sits at the intersection of product thinking, brand expression, behavioral insight, and interaction design. We’re constantly exploring new ways to make growth experiences feel more useful, intuitive, expressive, and distinctly Instacart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We pride ourselves on a culture of experimentation, accountability, and craft, continuously evolving how we design for conversion, engagement, retention, and long-term customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer II&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Lifecycle &amp;amp; Growth team and help shape some of Instacart’s most important customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a highly conceptual, craft-driven designer who is energized by ambiguous problems, 0→1 exploration, and bringing new ideas to life through exceptional visual, interaction, and motion design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across high-impact Growth initiatives spanning partnerships, incentives, and lifecycle experiences. The work may include exploring new partner-led entry points, rethinking how incentives are surfaced and understood, or creating new lifecycle experiences that improve conversion, reactivation, and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work at the intersection of product, brand, content, interaction design, and growth strategy, deeply understanding both the customer experience and the business mechanics behind it to create new ways for people to discover, engage with, and return to Instacart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Many of these opportunities won’t start with a defined solution. You’ll be expected to explore broadly, challenge existing patterns, and translate customer needs, business goals, and emerging capabilities into compelling product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll move fluidly between big-picture concepts and the smallest interaction details, developing new product ideas, prototyping behaviors, refining motion and micro-interactions, and carrying strong concepts through to polished execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact Growth initiatives across partnerships, incentives, and lifecycle experiences, taking work from ambiguous problem framing through exploration, refinement, and launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimagine key moments across the customer journey, including how people discover Instacart, understand value, convert, reactivate, and build ongoing habits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blend product thinking, brand, content, interaction design, and business mechanics to create unified experiences rather than solving individual surfaces in isolation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and prototype new content models, flows, interaction patterns, motion, and messaging that challenge existing conventions and unlock stronger customer and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design complex, multi-step journeys that span surfaces and teams, identifying opportunities to create greater continuity, clarity, and cohesion across the experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Marketing, Content Design, Research, Brand, and Data Science to synthesize diverse inputs into clear creative direction and actionable product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insight, experimentation, and business metrics to evaluate tradeoffs, shape recommendations, and iterate toward measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define scalable patterns and interaction models that extend beyond a single feature, improving quality and coherence across the broader Growth experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use prototypes, AI-enabled tools, and emerging workflows to make ideas tangible early, accelerate learning, and improve how teams explore and build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the craft bar through exceptional visual and interaction design, strong storytelling, and clear rationale that helps teams align around a shared direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience designing consumer-facing digital products across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating exceptional visual, interaction, and product craft, including strong 0→1 work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep interaction design skills, with experience in motion, micro-interactions, prototyping, and product behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conceptual thinking, with the ability to turn ambiguous opportunities into clear, compelling product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design complex journeys while balancing customer needs, business goals, technical constraints, and craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to articulate design rationale and influence cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating autonomously, exploring broadly, and carrying work from early concept through polished execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and fluency with AI-enabled tools and workflows, using them to accelerate exploration, prototyping, and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in growth, subscriptions, marketplace, commerce, or other high-scale consumer products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working where brand and product experience are deeply connected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prototyping or motion skills using Figma, Framer, ProtoPie, code, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exploring AI-powered product experiences or integrating AI into the design and prototyping process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instacart provides highly market-competitive compensation and benefits in each location where our employees work. This role is remote and the base pay range for a successful candidate is dependent on their permanent work location. Please review our Flex First remote work policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://instacart.careers/flex-first/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Currently, we are only hiring in the following provinces: Ontario, Alberta, British Columbia, and Nova Scotia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Offers may vary based on many factors, such as candidate experience and skills required for the role. Additionally, this role is eligible for a new hire equity grant as well as annual refresh grants. Please read more about our benefits offerings &lt;a href=&quot;https://instacart.careers/taste-of-instacart/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Canadian based candidates, the base pay ranges for a successful candidate are listed below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CAN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$171,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,500 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
